#DESCRIPTION
3D Standalone Martian Magnetosphere smoke test: Semi-Implicit Full-PIC on a coarse
24 x 32 x 32 grid (dx = 0.25 R_M), 20 s. Same physics as run_mars/PARAM.in.fullpic.
Derived from coupled GM-PC setup (PARAM.in.test.GMPC.FLEKS.Mars.lowres).
Physics & Features:
- Semi-implicit Newton-Krylov / GMRES electric field solver (EFIELDSOLVER).
- Absorbing and conducting spherical inner obstacle (BODY and BODYBOUNDARY) at r = 1.029 R_M.
- 5 plasma species: 0=e-, 1=H+, 2=O2+, 3=O+, 4=CO2+.
- 3 neutral exosphere components: H, O, CO2 (exponential profiles).
- 10-reaction Martian photochemistry and charge-exchange chemistry model.
- EUV optical depth attenuation (OPTICALDEPTH) with solar direction along +x.
- Realistic 2 nT Parker spiral IMF in x-y plane (SwBx = -1.12 nT, SwBy = 1.66 nT).
- Inflow solar wind upstream (+x) at 300 km/s, outflow at downstream (-x) and flanks (+/-y, +/-z).
- Uniform grid dx = dy = dz = 0.25 R_M = 849 km (24x32x32 = 24,576 cells).

